    {
      "content": "**[SEC] 01 · Enrich IP (sub)** — Mode badge: sub-story.\n\nTake one IP address, refuse it if it sits in a protected range, answer from the cache if the verdict is fresh, otherwise look it up in two reputation services, and return one verdict with a score, the sources consulted and a one-sentence summary. Never blocks, never writes to any security tool, never returns raw vendor payloads.\n\nInput: {ip, requester?, source?} · Output: {verdict, score, sources, summary} · Refused: {status: refused, reason, ip} · Failure: {status: error, error_category, retryable, message}\n\nCredentials by name: virustotal_api, abuseipdb_api · Resource: never_block · Record type: ioc_cache",
      "position": [-30, -420],
      "guid": "000000000000000000000000000000a1",
      "width": 420
    }
  ],
